+ * ARM64EC build falls into the `defined(__x86_64__)` arm below and asks for
+ * libmono-2.0-x86_64.dll. That file exists in the package and is an AMD64 PE,
+ * and loading it means calling an x86-64 DllMain from ARM64EC code, which the
